P host applications across many servers and tools.\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/develop/clients/client-best-practices\"}]},{\"title\":\"SDKs\",\"description\":\"Official SDKs for building with Model Context Protocol\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/sdk\"},{\"group\":\"Security\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Understanding Authorization in MCP\",\"description\":\"Learn how to implement secure authorization for MCP servers using OAuth 2.1 to protect sensitive resources and operations\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/tutorials/security/authorization\"},{\"title\":\"Security Best Practices\",\"description\":\"Security considerations, attack vectors, and best practices for MCP implementations\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/tutorials/security/security_best_practices\"}]}]},{\"group\":\"Developer tools\",\"pages\":[{\"group\":\"Inspector\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"MCP Inspector\",\"description\":\"Interactive developer tooling for testing and debugging MCP servers, in the browser, on the command line, and in the terminal\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/tools/inspector\"},{\"title\":\"Web client\",\"description\":\"A tab-by-tab walkthrough of the graphical MCP Inspector\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/tools/inspector/web\"},{\"title\":\"CLI client\",\"description\":\"Scripting the MCP Inspector: methods, output formats, exit codes, and CI recipes\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/tools/inspector/cli\"},{\"title\":\"TUI client\",\"description\":\"The terminal MCP Inspector: navigation, tabs, and keyboard reference\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/tools/inspector/tui\"},{\"title\":\"Configuration and flags\",\"description\":\"Catalog vs. config files, which client owns which flag, and every environment variable\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/tools/inspector/configuration\"},{\"title\":\"Authorization\",\"description\":\"How the MCP Inspector performs OAuth, re-authorizes mid-session, and shares tokens between its clients\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/tools/inspector/authorization\"},{\"title\":\"Protocol eras\",\"description\":\"How the Inspector negotiates legacy vs. modern MCP, and how every feature is handled between protocol eras\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/tools/inspector/protocol-eras\"},{\"title\":\"Recipes\",\"description\":\"Practical guides for transports, importing configs, reviewing MCP Apps, Docker, and network hosting\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/tools/inspector/recipes\"}]},{\"title\":\"Debugging\",\"description\":\"A comprehensive guide to debugging Model Context Protocol (MCP) integrations\",\"href\":\"/docs/2026-07-28/tools/debugging\"}]},{\"group\":\"Examples\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Example Servers\",\"description\":\"A list of example servers and implementations\",\"href\":\"/examples\"}]}]},{\"version\":\"Version 2025-11-25\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Version 2025-11-25\",\"href\":\"/docs/2025-11-25/getting-started/intro\"}]},{\"version\":\"Version 2025-06-18\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Version 2025-06-18\",\"href\":\"/docs/2025-06-18/getting-started/intro\"}]},{\"version\":\"Version 2025-03-26\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Version 2025-03-26\",\"href\":\"/docs/2025-03-26/getting-started/intro\"}]},{\"version\":\"Version 2024-11-05\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Version 2024-11-05\",\"href\":\"/docs/2024-11-05/getting-started/intro\"}]},{\"version\":\"Draft\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Draft\",\"href\":\"/docs/draft/getting-started/intro\"}]}]},{\"tab\":\"Specification\",\"versions\":[{\"version\":\"Version 2026-07-28 (latest)\",\"default\":true,\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Specification\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/specification/2026-07-28\"},{\"title\":\"Key Changes\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/specification/2026-07-28/changelog\"},{\"title\":\"Deprecated Features\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/specification/2026-07-28/deprecated\"},{\"title\":\"Architecture\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/specification/2026-07-28/architecture/index\"},{\"group\":\"Base Protocol\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Overview\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/spec